- Changing architecture.
- Adding user-facing features.

---

# General Rules

The AI agent MUST:

- Follow the engineering process defined in `.ai/processes/ENGINEERING_PROCESS.md`.
- Run `./bootstrap.sh` before starting any task.
- Load applicable standards before performing specialized tasks.
- Check `.ai/skills/SKILLS_INDEX.md` for relevant skills.
- Ask for clarification whenever requirements are ambiguous or incomplete.
- Never make undocumented architectural decisions.
- Never assume missing project requirements.
- Wait for explicit user approval before creating Git commits.
- Respect the pre-commit hook (Conventional Commits enforced automatically).